title: "Geoeconomic Exposure and the Cross-Section of Individual Stock Returns"
abstract: >-
  A firm-level geoeconomic exposure measure built from earnings-call transcripts via
  King-Lam-Roberts keyword discovery, and its pricing in the cross-section of stock returns.
